  "history": null,
  "answer": "The sample RFP sets these limits:\n\n- **Single issuer:** No more than **5%** of the portfolio at the time of purchase, excluding federal government or agency securities and IMRF’s designated cash reserve fund. [p. 5](IMRF__sample_investment_manager_rfp.pdf)\n- **Foreign issuers:** No more than **20%**; their securities must trade on the NYSE, ASE, or NASDAQ. [p. 5](IMRF__sample_investment_manager_rfp.pdf)\n- **Cash and cash equivalents:** No more than **10%**, except during cash withdrawals or contributions. [p. 6](IMRF__sample_investment_manager_rfp.pdf)\n\nThe portfolio is expected to outperform the **Russell 2000 Growth Index, net of fees**. [p. 3](IMRF__sample_investment_manager_rfp.pdf)",
